# scenario: saving-scanning
# Saving on this computer before its first scan ends: the tab says it is
# scanning, shows no balance as if known, and Receive waits for the scan.
click Saving
expect Scanning Saving's history…
expect-not Offline
expect —
expect-not No activity yet
shot tab
click Receive
expect Fedimix is scanning Saving's history. The address appears when the scan ends.
expect-not Could not get an address
shot receive
